hi my name is Ken shots and I'm Neel  Malhotra and we would like to introduce  you to the course on values-based  leadership this course is about how to  lead with our values and implement them  in our organizations gaining a better  understanding of our own value systems  can make us more effective managers and  help us be the kinds of leaders people  want to follow clarifying our value  systems will also help us make better  decisions for the benefit of key  stakeholders such as shareholders  employees customers and society at large  this course will address several key  questions in values-based leadership  should we make decisions based on our  gut intuitions how can we design  organizations to prevent at the  collapses what is the role of companies  in society how can we manage trade-offs  and weigh the consequences of our  actions and how can we engage in  perspective-taking  to build more inclusive and fair  organizations these questions are  complicated and they don't have easy  answers the goal of this course is to  engage with these thorny issues so that  we can better lead with our values by  the end of this course you will clarify  your own values gain a better  understanding of the diversity of  ethical perspectives in business and  learn how to lead and design  organizations to implement your personal  values
 

